Hello,
I have a problem with my title. I cannot move it  down in my cover page . I´m using rstudio with knitR under linux.

---
title: |
  | Project  Report
  | My report description

output:
  pdf_document:
    fig_caption: yes

header-includes:
  \fancypagestyle{titlepage}{
  \fancyfoot[LE,RO]{\thepage\ of \pageref{LastPage}}
  \fancyfoot[LE,LO]{Project}
  \fancyhead[L]{\includegraphics[width=4cm]{logo.png}}
  }
...
...
...
  }
fontsize: 12pt

---

\vspace*{3cm}
\thispagestyle{titlepage}

The title is always at the upper part of the file. How can i move the title down to the position i would like without loosing my style ???

